    "payload": {
      "content": "After preprocessing, the dataset was divided into training, valida-\ntion, and testing partitions. The splits were stratified by class while \ngrouping all images of the same physical artifact to prevent leakage \nacross the sets. We adopted a 70%/15%/15% ratio, consistent across \nthe three classification tasks (pamor, dhapur, and tangguh), as sum-\nmarized in Table 1. This stratification ensured that minority classes"
