    "depth": 0,
    "payload": {
      "content": "Table 2\nYOLOv8 blade detector training hyperparameters.\n Parameter\nValue\nDescription\n \n Variant\nYOLOv8x\nHigh capacity for thin edges and curved blades.  \n Epochs\n300\nSufficient cycles to learn complex contours.\n \n Image size\n512\nPreserves detail while fitting batch size 32.\n \n Batch size\n32\nBalances stability and memory efficiency.\n \n Optimizer\nAdamW\nDecoupled weight decay improved generalization. \n Initial LR\n5 × 10−4\nConservative start to avoid divergence.\n \n Final LR\n0.01\nCosine decay to 1% of the initial rate.\n \n Dropout\n0.10\nLight regularization against overfitting.\n \n Patience\n30\nEarly stop if validation stalls.\n \n Seed\n42\nEnsures reproducibility across the runs.\n \n AMP\nTrue\nMixed precision for speed and lower VRAM.\n \n Workers\n4\nParallel data loading for a stable throughput."
