      "layout_reading_order": 15,
      "semantic_origin": "pdf_text"
    },
    "depth": 0,
    "payload": {
      "content": "To balance the representation across classes, each original image \ngenerated at least two augmented variants, with additional oversam-\npling of minority categories until parity with the largest class was \nachieved. This procedure produced balanced datasets with realistic \nvariations in blade appearance while maintaining domain consistency \nthrough constant white backgrounds. Representative examples are \nshown in Fig. 3."
    },
