    },
    "depth": 0,
    "payload": {
      "content": "The KerisRDNet classifier head comprised GlobalAveragePooling, \nDense(512)–BatchNorm–ReLU–Dropout(0.5), Dense(256)–BatchNorm–\nReLU–Dropout(0.5), and a task-specific softmax output. The internal \ndesign of an IRD block is shown in Fig. 4, and the stage-wise tensor \nmap is presented in Table 3."
    },
